            "text": "\\left(\\text{put}\\ y\\ = \\ 2a\\sin ^{2}\\left(\\dfrac{t}{2}\\right)\\ \\text{and}\\ m\\ = \\ \\tan \\left(\\dfrac{t}{2}\\right)\\ \\text{from}\\ \\text{step}\\ 1\\right)",
